This repository's engineering rules live in [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) and
`docs/engineering/` (architecture, code-style, testing, security,
accessibility, git-workflow). Read AGENTS.md before making changes — it is
the canonical, tool-agnostic contract that Claude, Codex, Cursor, and human
contributors all follow. Do not restate or fork these rules; if you find
yourself wanting a different convention, update AGENTS.md instead of
diverging in Cursor-only behavior.

Cursor-specific notes:

- Inspect neighboring files in the editor context before generating new code
  for a screen/component/feature — this repo has established patterns
  (`src/shared/components/ui.tsx` for primitives, `src/theme/tokens.ts` for
  design tokens, `src/types/domain.ts` for shared domain types).
- Do not invent undefined Muskil Aasan product behavior (payments,
  verification/NID, escrow, job lifecycle, cancellation, ratings, matching,
  location privacy, fees) — see AGENTS.md's "Do not invent product behavior"
  section. Ask instead of guessing.
- Before finishing a change, the equivalents of `npm run format:check`,
  `npm run lint`, `npm run typecheck`, and `npm test` should pass.
